 "Following on the previous exercise, using this model find the dark states \
of the atom-field system. This amounts to finding states \[Psi] such that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["H", "I"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "61890ee9-48a4-e44c-906c-dd265017d3f6"],
